#: ../../source/reference/generated/utils/pams.utils.hill_tail_index.rst:7
msgid "hill_tail_index"
msgstr "hill_tail_index"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index:1
msgid "Estimate the tail index of a distribution with the Hill estimator."
msgstr "Hill推定量により分布の裾指数を推定します。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index:3
msgid ""
"The absolute values are sorted in descending order, :math:`x_{(1)} \\ge "
"x_{(2)} \\ge \\dots \\ge x_{(n)}`, and the largest :math:`k = \\lfloor q "
"n \\rfloor` of them are used, where :math:`q` is ``tail_fraction``: "
":math:`\\hat{\\alpha} = k / \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\log (x_{(i)} / x_{(k+1)})` "
"(Hill, 1975). Both tails are pooled because the absolute values are used."
msgstr ""
"絶対値を降順に並べ :math:`x_{(1)} \\ge x_{(2)} \\ge \\dots \\ge x_{(n)}`、そのうち最大の "
":math:`k = \\lfloor q n \\rfloor` 個を用いて :math:`\\hat{\\alpha} = k / "
"\\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\log (x_{(i)} / x_{(k+1)})` を求めます（Hill, 1975）。ここで "
":math:`q` は ``tail_fraction`` です。絶対値を用いるため、両側の裾をまとめて扱います。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index:10
msgid ""
"A smaller value means a heavier tail. For a power-law tail :math:`P(|X| >"
" x) \\propto x^{-\\alpha}`, the estimate approaches :math:`\\alpha`. For "
"a thin tail, the estimate is finite but large: for 8,000 Gaussian samples"
" and ``tail_fraction=0.05``, it is about 6."
msgstr ""
"値が小さいほど裾が重いことを意味します。べき乗則に従う裾 :math:`P(|X| > x) \\propto x^{-\\alpha}` "
"では、推定値は :math:`\\alpha` に近づきます。裾が軽い場合、推定値は有限ですが大きくなります。8,000個の正規分布の標本と "
"``tail_fraction=0.05`` では約6です。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index:16
msgid "samples, e.g. log returns."
msgstr "標本。例えば対数リターン。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index:19
msgid ""
"fraction :math:`q` of the samples used as the tail. It must be in (0, 1)."
" Defaults to 0.05."
msgstr "裾として用いる標本の割合 :math:`q`。(0, 1) の範囲である必要があります。デフォルトは0.05です。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index:23
msgid "estimated tail index."
msgstr "推定した裾指数。"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of pams.utils.stylized_facts.hill_tail_index:27
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "例"

